Z||000000||Formula||03-11-2001||02:03 PM||||I'm switching from electronics engineering to business.... electronics is a 2 year (which will take me 3 to complete now because of one stupid test, and business is 4 year).<P>has anyone here taken a 4 year business program or knows anyone who has taken it and how did you/they like it?  Im going into this one blind. (and I still get to keep my really good internship this summer because I can program better then everybody in my class, heh)<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/yellowtored3.jpg"> ||||reg||1
