Z||000007||DaRkLoRD||03-15-2001||06:43 PM||||I kinda did the same thing, but backwards.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>I started out in Electro-mechanical engineering, and hated it.. so in 2nd semester I switched programs and I'm now focusing on my minor which is Biotechnology.. (and loving it, btw.. biotech is awesome) anyway, I just found out I've been accepted into electronics engineering for the fall semester..<P>I couldn't stand going into business.. I can barely stand the math for my own business, I can't imagine studying that in school. but that's just me.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>------------------<BR>  <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||10
